WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
With Amazon Buy Shipping, you can access Amazon's negotiated shipping rates or link your own rates

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
from your FedEx or UPS account for seller-fulfilled prime or non-prime orders.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Before linking a carrier account, there are two steps you need to take.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
First, review the terms and conditions in the Buy Shipping Services Terms and Conditions Help page.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Second, update your contact information in the Buy Shipping Preferences.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Go to Settings, click Account Info, click Shipping and Returns Information, then Buy Shipping Preferences.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.611
Under Manage Your Ship From Locations, click Edit and review or update your email address and phone

00:00:46.611 --> 00:00:47.000
number.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.400
To begin linking your carrier accounts, go to Buy Shipping Preferences in Seller Central and click

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.000
Manage Your Carrier Accounts.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.867
Then click Link Account.

00:00:56.867 --> 00:01:02.000
Choose either the FedEx or UPS tile to start the process.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.923
For FedEx accounts, you'll need to provide your 9-digit account number, contact information including

00:01:08.923 --> 00:01:14.000
name and address, your FedEx email address and your company name.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:21.083
For UPS accounts, you'll need your UPS account number, the account zip code from your original UPS

00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:24.000
registration and your current shipping location information.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.000
After entering your information, you'll authenticate your account.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.000
For FedEx, you'll receive a one-time password by email or phone.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
For UPS, you'll sign in through the UPS website using your UPS.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.000
com credentials.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Once authentication is complete, your account status will show as active.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.263
It's important to note that your shipping rates should appear within 3-5 business days after linking

00:01:52.263 --> 00:01:53.000
your account.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:00.714
If you linked your FedEx account before May 2025 or your UPS account uses Access Key-Based Authorization,

00:02:00.714 --> 00:02:05.000
you'll need to re-authenticate your accounts in Seller Central.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Without re-authentication, you'll only see Amazon's pre-negotiated rates instead of your own.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:17.346
To re-authenticate your accounts, go to Manage Your Carrier Accounts and select Authenticate next

00:02:17.346 --> 00:02:22.000
to your FedEx or UPS account and enter your account information.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:30.550
For FedEx, choose to receive a one-time password by email or phone and enter the password to complete

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.000
authentication.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.714
For UPS, sign in through the UPS website using your UPS.

00:02:35.714 --> 00:02:40.000
com credentials and follow the prompts to complete the process.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Each UPS account must be re-authenticated individually.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.714
The Merchant Fulfillment API is another way for you to purchase shipping through Buy Shipping without

00:02:50.714 --> 00:02:55.000
the need to log in to your Seller account in Seller Central.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.684
You'll need to review and agree to the terms and conditions for each carrier service you plan to

00:03:00.684 --> 00:03:01.000
use.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:08.000
After reviewing, select the "I agree" checkbox for each carrier, then select Submit.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:14.774
If you experience any issues during the linking or authentication process, such as frozen pages

00:03:14.774 --> 00:03:21.548
or validation errors, visit the Manage Your Carrier Accounts and the Buy Shipping Preferences Help

00:03:21.548 --> 00:03:22.000
pages.
